{
 "id": "nse-ucc-download",
 "title": "UCC download from NSE (UCI Online)",
 "party": "NSE",
 "direction": "in",
 "when": "As needed (at least monthly)",
 "purpose": "The client details as NSE's UCC database holds them, downloaded from the exchange's UCC system. Name the file with nse_ucc_download in it (for example nse_ucc_download_20261120.csv) and drop it on Exchange files. Columns are read by their header names in any order; other columns are ignored. Only the client code is required; a field whose column is not in the file is not compared.",
 "linked": "Not kept as a file: each client's PAN, mobile, email, primary bank account with IFSC and correspondence address are kept as fingerprints (one-way hashes) with masked tails, and compared with Ledgerline's client details by the self-inspection test 'Client details at the exchanges match Ledgerline' (uccfields.go). A download older than 45 days is ignored.",
